  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PDP IV &#x2013; Advancing the clinical development of placental malaria vaccines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is implemented under the PDP IV programme by the European Vaccine Initiative (EVI). EVI&apos;s mission is to reduce the burden of poverty-related infectious diseases through the development of new, safe, effective, and affordable vaccines against diseases that disproportionately affect low- and middle-income countries (LMICs). Vulnerable populations, notably children and women of childbearing age, are the target groups of EVI&apos;s efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
